          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "गुन्हा — gunhā — \"a crime; an offence\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "खोटी सही करणं हा मोठा गुन्हा आहे. khoṭī sahī karṇaṁ hā moṭhā gunhā āhe. Forging a signature is a serious crime."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The oblique is गुन्ह्या-: गुन्ह्यात, in the crime."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "गुन्हा (gunhā) is a loan from Persian gunāh, 'a sin, a fault'; in Marathi it became the everyday and the legal word for an offence."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
