            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "त्या दुकानदाराने आम्हाला फसवलं. tyā dukāndārāne āmhālā phasavlaṁ. That shopkeeper cheated us."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with -ने (he …): त्याने फसवलं, tyāne phasavlaṁ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The one cheated takes -ला: लोकांना फसवणे (phasavṇe), to cheat people."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
