              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "फसवणे (phasavṇe) is inherited: CDIAL lists Marathi phasavṇe, 'to deceive', under Sanskrit spāśayati, 'causes to be bound or stopped' (CDIAL 13814). To cheat is to snare."
            }
